id: freertos_heap_1
label: FreeRTOS Heap 1
package: freertos
description: 'A heap implementation for FreeRTOS.

  The simplest possible implementation of pvPortMalloc().  Note that this implementation does NOT allow allocated memory to be freed again.

  '
category: RTOS|FreeRTOS
quality: production
metadata:
